   {
    "id": "022dad9f-565b-47c7-a028-1e14c287de0a",
    "city": null,
    "date": "2025-11-27",
    "time": "7:30pm - 12am",
    "price": null,
    "state": null,
    "title": "DANCEGIVING @ Solar Fusion!",
    "venue": null,
    "banner": null,
    "region": null,
    "address": null,
    "event_id": "58fada75-6417-4167-bce4-7153e8669f5e",
    "created_at": "2025-09-25T21:58:53.277874+00:00",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-25T21:58:53.277874+00:00",
    "class_count": null,
    "description": "<p class=\"m-0 p-0\">We're holding a special event for Thanksgiving! <br><br>Come early for a <strong>community pot-luck</strong> from 7:30-9pm! Bring something to share (or just bring yourself) and let's hang out together. <br><br>Dancing 9pm-midnight</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">We’ll have snacks in the kitchen, and water will be available on site. Please bring a water bottle.</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"><strong>~ Cost ~<br></strong>Sliding Scale $5 - $25 ($15 suggested)<br>No one turned away for lack of funds/NOTAFLOF. Reach out for details. We want everyone who wants to make it, to get to be here!<br>Volunteers get in for free! Reach out if you want to help!</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"><strong>~ Venue Info ~<br></strong>The dance floor is on the second story, you will need to walk up a flight of stairs (no elevator)</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Dog-friendly (as long as your dog is chill and will get along with Tito, the owner’s dog who may also be there)</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"><strong>~ Getting There ~<br></strong>Check the RWC downtown parking map for info on street parking and garages. Marshall St Garage is a 5 min walk and should be about $2-$3 to park for the evening. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.redwoodcity.org/about-the-city/visiting/downtown-parking\"><strong>https://www.redwoodcity.org/about-the-city/visiting/downtown-parking</strong></a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">We’re also just a half mile walk from Caltrain!</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Carpooling is encouraged! Request or offer a ride in our carpool sheet: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://tinyurl.com/solarfusioncarpool\"><strong>https://tinyurl.com/solarfusioncarpool</strong></a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Please read our Code of Conduct: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.solarfusion.dance/code-of-conduct\">https://www.solarfusion.dance/code-of-conduct</a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Questions, comments, concerns- email us at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"mailto:SolarFusionDance@gmail.com\">SolarFusionDance@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Also check us out at:</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Website: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.solarfusion.dance/\"><strong>https://www.solarfusion.dance/</strong></a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Instagram: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/solarfusiondance/\"><strong>https://www.instagram.com/solarfusiondance/</strong></a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Facebook: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events/808071818269528/\"><strong>https://www.facebook.com/events/808071818269528/</strong></a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Partiful:<strong> </strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://partiful.com/u/HMdsyQ3Hw3ii7RxWfBeS\"><strong>https://partiful.com/u/HMdsyQ3Hw3ii7RxWfBeS</strong></a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p>",
    "external_link": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd3b12f6-7b56-4fd6-ae28-47a97402295e",
