    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T22:03:53.091244+00:00",
    "class_count": null,
    "description": "<p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Solar Fusion in the West Bay</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Come dance with us on 2nd and 4th Thursdays at Luna del Soul dance studio in Redwood City.<br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.solarfusion.dance/\">SolarFusion.dance</a><br></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">9:15-10:30pm- high energy MACROfusion set! <br>10:30pm- 12am- tone it down to smooth &lt;micro&gt; dancing</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"><br>Dancing starts at 9:15pm until midnight</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">We’ll have snacks in the kitchen, and water will be available on site. Please bring a water bottle.</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"><strong>~ Cost ~<br></strong>Sliding Scale $5 - $25 ($15 suggested)<br>No one turned away for lack of funds/NOTAFLOF. Reach out for details. We want everyone who wants to make it, to get to be here!<br>Volunteers get in for free! Reach out if you want to help!</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"><strong>~ Venue Info ~<br></strong>The dance floor is on the second story, you will need to walk up a flight of stairs (no elevator)</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Dog-friendly (as long as your dog is chill and will get along with Tito, the owner’s dog who may also be there)</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"><strong>~ Getting There ~<br></strong>Check the RWC downtown parking map for info on street parking and garages. Marshall St Garage is a 5 min walk and should be about $2-$3 to park for the evening. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.redwoodcity.org/about-the-city/visiting/downtown-parking\"><strong>https://www.redwoodcity.org/about-the-city/visiting/downtown-parking</strong></a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">We’re also just a half mile walk from Caltrain!</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Carpooling is encouraged! Request or offer a ride in our carpool sheet: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://tinyurl.com/solarfusioncarpool\"><strong>https://tinyurl.com/solarfusioncarpool</strong></a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Please read our Code of Conduct: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.solarfusion.dance/code-of-conduct\">https://www.solarfusion.dance/code-of-conduct</a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Questions, comments, concerns- email us at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"mailto:SolarFusionDance@gmail.com\">SolarFusionDance@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\"></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Also check us out at:</p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Website: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.solarfusion.dance/\"><strong>https://www.solarfusion.dance/</strong></a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Instagram: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/solarfusiondance/\"><strong>https://www.instagram.com/solarfusiondance/</strong></a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Facebook: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events/808071818269528/\"><strong>https://www.facebook.com/events/808071818269528/</strong></a></p><p class=\"m-0 p-0\">Partiful:<strong> </strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\" href=\"https://partiful.com/u/HMdsyQ3Hw3ii7RxWfBeS\"><strong>https://partifu